## Overview

The AI-Powered Recruitment Agency Platform ingests large batches of candidate resumes (1000+ per job
profile), builds a **fresh Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipeline per job profile**, and uses an
LLM (OpenAI GPT-4o) to rank every candidate against a structured job description. Results are persisted to
PostgreSQL, exported to a styled Excel workbook, pushed to HR via a message queue + email + in-app
notifications, and visualised in real time on a Next.js dashboard.

### Tech Stack Summary

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Backend | Node.js + Express.js |
| Frontend | Next.js (React, TypeScript) |
| Vector DB | ChromaDB |
| Relational DB | PostgreSQL |
| PDF Parsing | LangChain.js `PDFLoader` / `pdf-parse` |
| Embeddings | HuggingFace `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` (384-dim) |
| LLM | OpenAI GPT-4o / GPT-4-turbo |
| RAG Framework | LangChain.js |
| Message Queue | **RabbitMQ** (recommended — see §1.4) |
| Cache | Redis |
| API Gateway | **Kong** (recommended — see §1.8) |
| Excel Export | ExcelJS |
| Real-time UI | Socket.IO |
| Auth | JWT + RBAC |
| Object Storage | AWS S3 |

