## 1.6 RBAC Design

### Roles
- **SuperAdmin** — platform owner; full access across all agencies.
- **AgencyAdmin** — manages an agency's users, job profiles, and rankings.
- **Recruiter** — uploads resumes, creates job profiles, triggers ranking for assigned profiles.
- **HR (client-side viewer)** — read-only access to ranking results & Excel for explicitly assigned profiles.

### Permission Matrix

| Action | SuperAdmin | AgencyAdmin | Recruiter | HR |
|--------|:---------:|:-----------:|:---------:|:--:|
| Manage agencies | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Manage users (within agency) | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Create/edit job profiles | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| Upload resumes | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| Trigger ranking | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| View ranking results | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (assigned only) |
| Download Excel export | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (assigned only) |
| Manage notification prefs | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| View audit logs | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |

### JWT Claims
```json
{
  "user_id": "u_8f3a...",
  "role": "Recruiter",
  "agency_id": "ag_1024",
  "assigned_job_profile_ids": ["jp_01", "jp_07"],
  "iat": 1750000000,
  "exp": 1750000900
}
```

### Express Middleware
`requireRole(['AgencyAdmin', 'Recruiter'])` guards routes (full code in §3.5). For HR, an additional
ownership check verifies the requested `job_profile_id` is in `assigned_job_profile_ids`.

### API Gateway Enforcement
Kong's JWT plugin validates signature + expiry **before** routing upstream, so unauthenticated requests never
reach Express. Fine-grained role/ownership checks happen in the Express middleware.

