  total: number; excelUrl: string; durationMs: number;
}
```

### Recharts integration approach
A `useRankingSocket(jobProfileId)` hook (full code in §3.8) subscribes to the room and exposes
`{ progress, results, isComplete, excelUrl }`. Chart components derive their datasets from `results` via
`useMemo`, so every incoming `ranking:result` event re-renders the charts incrementally without a full refetch.

